as sweaty sneakers. Rotor cupping can also cause a slap-shlap sound, kind of like a manic chairs greeting, sometimes bowl search when you hit the warped brick.\n\nGot it? If your brakes are loud and your pad replacement tree is sprouting new leaves, those are the usual culprits lightweight. Stay sharp out here\u2014brake squeal\u2019s not vanity driving, it\u2019s the brakes trying to scream out the rotor fast. Good luck.", "n_new_tokens": 315, "finish_reason": "stop", "scores": {"detector_version": "2026-10-03.3", "tracer_bee_enacted": false, "tracer_crow_enacted": false, "category": "neither", "bee_refs": 0, "crow_refs": 0, "bee_strong": false, "crow_strong": false, "excluded_quotation": 0, "excluded_denial": 0, "excluded_meta": 0, "excluded_user_requested": 0, "story_form": false, "story_form_cues": {"stage_direction": false, "third_person_narration": false, "attributed_dialogue": false, "speaker_lines": false, "fake_user_turn": false, "scene_setting": false}, "identity_adoption_candidate": false, "refusal": false, "empty": false, "truncated": false, "n_words": 239, "n_sentences": 16, "task_completion_heuristic": true, "prohibition_mentioned": false}, "Y_H": false, "Y_D": false}
